cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use tzun-verify in your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: tzun-verify
abstract: >-
  The standalone verifier for Decision Evidence Object (DEO) proof bundles.
  It checks a Tzun evidence record without any Tzun code: it recomputes the
  record's digest, checks its inclusion in the anchored log, recomputes the
  value published on chain, and compares it with the public ledger through
  any Ethereum node the auditor chooses.
authors:
  - name: Tzun, Inc.
repository-code: https://github.com/TzunAI/tzun-verify
url: https://spec.tzun.ai/
license: BSD-3-Clause-Clear
keywords:
  - verification
  - transparency log
  - Merkle tree
  - RFC 3161
  - Ethereum
  - audit trail
  - human-in-the-loop
